    thinking: "**Defining the Architecture**\n\nOkay, I\'m starting to build a robust architecture for multi-market listings. I\'m focusing on defining the required components and system changes. Currently, I\'m examining and documenting the necessary types and models within the frontend. I\'m aiming for a systematic and clean design.\n\n\n**Refining the Types**\n\nI\'ve been honing the data types needed. Specifically, I\'ve exported ListingMarketStatus, ListingMarketPublication, MarketEligibilityResult, and MultiMarketValidationResult. I\'ve also updated the Listing interface, adding marketCode, primaryMarketCode, and marketPublications. I\'ve made corresponding changes in the publication types, including modifications to the PublicationDraftState. Additionally, the market types are updated with configurations for taxomony and listings, like category-specific restrictions.\n\n\n**Expanding Market Configurations**\n\nI\'m now incorporating several new market-specific configurations. I\'m adding `allowCrossBorderPublication`, `maxActiveMarketsPerListing`, `requireParcelShippingForCrossBorder`, and `crossBorderProOnly`. Also, I\'m working on a market capabilities service. I\'m designing functions such as `getEligibleMarketsForListing` and `validateListingForMarkets` to handle market eligibility and draft validation.\n\n\n**Integrating Market Functions**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial helper functions: `getListingMarketCodes`, `isListingPublishedInMarket`, and `formatMarketPublicationsSummary`. I\'m also re-exporting the multi-market capabilities methods into `marketService`, and updating `marketService` to support taxonomy toggles and category enabling/disabling per market. Further, I\'ve updated `publication.service.ts` to support `targetMarketCodes` and `marketPublications` in methods like `validateDraft` and `publishListing`.\n\n\n**Implementing Data Handling**\n\nI\'m now focusing on critical data handling methods. I\'m updating `updateListing` to preserve and update `marketPublications` and `targetMarketCodes`. I\'m also ensuring `duplicateListing` properly copies `marketPublications` with updated timestamps and statuses. Furthermore, I\'ve created a helper to modify a listing\'s market publication status.\n\n\n"
